  "notes": "Captured with the Ctrl+K command palette open: the whole app behind it is blurred and dimmed grey. Palette is shadcn/cmdk-like: 480px white card, 8px radius, 1px #e6e6e6 border, uppercase section headers, rows with line icon + name + description + monospace key chip; selected row inverted to navy #182335 with white text. Monochrome navy/slate palette on near-white; only accent is the red trash icon for Delete all (which has an inline 'Confirm' second step in the tree). Avatars are navy circles with white initials (fully rounded); read emails get pale avatar and muted text. Single-key shortcuts (r, a, s, /, j, k, c) are surfaced in tooltips, the search field and the palette."
